    "/v1/skills/animated-sketch-diagram/render_html_to_gif": {
      "post": {
        "description": "Render supplied HTML/SVG/CSS in an isolated container. Scripts, external resources and local file references are rejected; no natural-language diagram generation is provided. Input is limited to 256 KiB, 2000 elements and 120 million pixel-frames. HTTP 200 is a task snapshot, not proof of completion. Save job_id and query at least 5 seconds apart with bounded polling. Inspect status, result and error_code; do not automatically resubmit submission_unknown. Reuse request_id and identical parameters when retrying the same operation.",
